<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!--
  Ltse Equities Memoir Depth Feed Sbe v2.0, transcribed from the pdf. LTSE published no SBE xml schema
  for v2.0, so this file was written by hand from "MEMOIR Depth Feed for LTSE-v2.0.pdf" (MEMOIR Depth
  Feed v2.0, OmiDocuments Ltse/MEMOIR), checked against the LTSE "Specification Errata" (June 2026,
  section 3.1), starting from LTSE's published v1.3 schema (memoir-depth.xml). It is not an LTSE file.

  From the pdf: SchemaId 2, header unchanged (6 bytes); version 512 (0x0200) from the v2.0 hex dumps.
  Instrument Directory drops Reserved and MPV; Security Trading Status adds HaltReason; Order Added adds
  OrderFlags (the pdf header row still says BlockLength=31, the field table and hex dump give 32);
  Auction Status (19), Auction Trade (20), Broken Auction Trade (21) and Corrected Auction Trade (22)
  are new (Corrected Auction Trade BlockLength is cut off in the pdf; 66 from the fields and hex dump).
  Enum value names follow the pdf, and the names its v2.0 encoder examples use (RegularTrade,
  AuctionTrade); values whose pdf text is unchanged keep their v1.3 schema names.
  The errata says ReferenceBuyQuantity, ReferenceSellQuantity and AuctionQuantity are INT64; the v2.0
  pdf message tables print UINT64, which this file follows.
  Not printed in the pdf, carried from v1.3: package and field ids.
-->
